10, land navigation 36+5 at 4 per level, wilderness survival 30+10, identify plants is Identify Plants & Fruit 25+5, skin hides 30+10, preserve food 25+5, cook 35+5, demon and monster lore 25+5, basic math 45+20, intelligence 32+5, paramedic 40+10; general athletics is Athletics (general). Hand to Hand: Martial Arts with no upgrade price, so no hand_to_hand block. Six secondary skills from any category except Medical, Electrical and Science (every other catalog category listed except Cowboy). || MAGIC: the talisman is a trackable resource (three a day), not a spell grant. || EQUIPMENT: not stored. A dagger, vibro-blade, net gun, laser wrist blaster and mental incapacitator are standard issue only to warriors accompanying a Splugorth Slaver, and a player character is typically a rogue; the net gun, mental incapacitator, padded armor and bio-wizard devices have no gear rows. Listed in the body. || No starting money is printed."
